  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.7.0 completes the refresh and output optimization release. DCurses adds opt-in Terminal-owned synchronized-output framing; deterministic cost-aware cursor-motion and erase selection; exact physical insert/delete-character and insert/delete-line/scroll-region optimization with conservative retained-screen and failure-recovery gates; and differential rendition transitions that preserve reset-first safety whenever state must be normalized. The accepted public delta is limited to CursesSessionOptions.UseSynchronizedOutput, default false; cost models, selectors, operation plans, retained physical state, and measurement infrastructure remain internal. Deterministic release-gate fixtures include a 19-to-13-byte styled-cell improvement, a 2-vs-34-byte editor insertion, a 4-vs-166-byte pager deletion, a 160x60 full repaint, and 1,000 repeated small refreshes. Dependencies remain Icod.Terminal 1.4.0 and Icod.TermInfo 1.10.0.",
